          ],
          "correct": 0,
          "answer": "$a_n = a_1 + (n - 1)d \\Rightarrow 87 = 7 + (n - 1)(4) \\Rightarrow 80 = 4(n - 1) \\Rightarrow 20 = n - 1 \\Rightarrow n = 21$."
